			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401930301,
					"content": "老板！这「三川花祭」可真不错！这几天来我们这儿的游客数量，比平时翻了三倍啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401930302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蓝川丞"
				},
				{
					"id": 401930302,
					"content": "这个月的营业金额…恐怕能上这个数！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401930303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蓝川丞"
				},
				{
					"id": 401930303,
					"content": "很不错嘛，看来这个月，说不定能正面击败八重堂…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401930304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梦见月瑞希"
				},
				{
					"id": 401930304,
					"content": "什么事情这么高兴？怎么不叫上我？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401930305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 401930305,
					"content": "啊哈…也没什么…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401930306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梦见月瑞希"
				},
				{
					"id": 401930306,
					"content": "哦，我倒是有个好消息忘了跟你分享…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401930307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 401930307,
					"content": "「三川花祭」的三成收益，都会划到八重堂的账上哦。这个月应该能创纪录了吧？来恭喜我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401930308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 401930308,
					"content": "什么——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401930309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梦见月瑞希"
				},
				{
					"id": 401930309,
					"content": "那…那不如，恭喜老板在第三百三十三次挑战八重堂营收的尝试中，取得了亚军的好成绩！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401930310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蓝川丞"
				},
				{
					"id": 401930310,
					"content": "呵呵呵…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401930311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 401930311,
					"content": "…祝愿今夜，人人皆得「好梦」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				}
			]
		},
